{title: 456 - My Lord and I}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #456 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 456}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]I [Bb]have [F]a Friend so [C7]pre[Dm]cious, [F7]So [Bb]very dear [Bbm]to[F]me,
[F]He [Bb]loves [F]me with a [C7]ten[F]der love, He [Dm]loves so [G7]faithful[C]ly;
[F]I [C7]could not [F]live [C7]apart [F]from Him, [F7]I[D]love to feel Him [Gm7]nigh;
[C]And [F]so we dwell together, My Lord [C7]and [F]I.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F][Bb]Sometimes [F][C7]I'm [Dm][F7]faint [Bb][Bbm]and [F]weary,
[F][Bb]He [F]knows [C7]that [F][Dm]I [G7]am [C]weak,
[F]And [C7]as [F]He [C7]bids [F]me [F7]lean [D]on [Gm7]Him,
[C]His [F]help [C7]I [F]gladly seek;
[F][Bb]He [F]leads [C7]me [Dm]in [F7]the [Bb]paths [Bbm]of [F]light,
[F][Bb]Beneath [F][C7]a [F][Dm]sunny [G7][C]sky,
[F][C7]And [F][C7]so [F]we [F7][D]walk [Gm7]together,
[C]My [F]Lord [C7]and [F]I.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F][Bb]I [F]tell [C7][Dm]Him [F7]all [Bb][Bbm]my [F]sorrows,
[F][Bb]I [F]tell [C7]Him [F][Dm]all [G7]my [C]joys,
[F][C7]I [F]tell [C7]Him [F]all [F7]that [D]pleases [Gm7]me,
[C]I [F]tell [C7]Him [F]what annoys;
[F][Bb]He [F]tells [C7]me [Dm]what [F7]I [Bb]ought [Bbm]to [F]do,
[F][Bb]He [F]tells [C7]me [F][Dm]how [G7]to [C]try,
[F][C7]And [F][C7]so [F]we [F7][D]talk [Gm7]together,
[C]My [F]Lord [C7]and [F]I.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[F][Bb]He [F]knows [C7][Dm]that [F7]I [Bb][Bbm]am [F]longing
[F][Bb]Some [F][C7]weary [F]soul [Dm][G7]to [C]win,
[F]And [C7]so [F]He [C7]bids [F]me [F7]go [D]and [Gm7]speak
[C]The [F]loving [C7]word [F]for Him;
[F][Bb]He [F]bids [C7]me [Dm][F7]tell [Bb]His [Bbm]wondrous [F]love,
[F][Bb]And [F]why [C7]He [F][Dm]came [G7]to [C]die,
[F][C7]And [F][C7]so [F]we [F7][D]work [Gm7]together,
[C]My [F]Lord [C7]and [F]I.
{end_of_verse}
